What:		/cgroup.freeze
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		The cgroup v2 freezer control inherited from the OnePlus 9R
		Android 14 kernel.  It is present in each non-root cgroup on a
		cgroup v2 hierarchy.  Writing 1 requests that the cgroup and its
		descendants freeze; writing 0 releases that request.  Reads return
		the requested state.

What:		/cgroup.events frozen
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		The "frozen" line in cgroup.events reports 1 only after all
		eligible tasks and descendants reached the frozen state, and 0
		otherwise.  State changes generate the normal kernfs notification.

What:		NETLINK_OPLUS_HANS cgroup-v2 capability report
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		After the HANS loopback handshake, the kernel sends a PKG message
		with code -99.  A FROZEN_TRANS or CPUCTL_TRANS query using target
		UID -8000 returns the same report.  This matches the OnePlus 9R
		Android 14 HANS userspace contract and selects cgroup v2 freezing.
